---
layout: base.njk
---
{# Guides carry their own H1 in the markdown body so the page stays
   byte-identical to the #guide note it mirrors in the vault (vault_path is
   the drift checker's join key). Unlike guide.njk, this layout renders NO
   title of its own — the body's H1 is the heading. The footer frame below
   lives in the LAYOUT, keeping the markdown body canonical. #}
<main>
    <article class="post-content fade-up fade-up-2">
        {{ content | safe }}

        <div class="post-nav fade-up fade-up-3">
            <p class="guide-frame">This guide ships inside every new Parachute vault as a note tagged <code>#guide</code> &mdash; yours to edit.</p>
            <a href="/guides/">All guides &rarr;</a>
        </div>
    </article>
</main>
